<p><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Segoe UI,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Hello {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</span></span><br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Segoe UI,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">We have reviewed your flight activity for the past 12-months and can see that you’re close to meeting the required status credits to retain Platinum One.&nbsp;</span></span></p>
<span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Segoe UI,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"> In recognition of your loyalty to Qantas, we are pleased to advise that&nbsp;we will extend your Platinum One status until <strong>&lt;30 July 2026&gt;</strong>. This is a one-time gesture of goodwill and to retain your status beyond this date, you will need to earn the <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/status-and-clubs/status.html" id="LPlnk194676" title="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/status-and-clubs/status.html">required status credits</a>.<br />
<br />
Thank you for your continued support, we look forward to welcoming you on board again soon.</span></span>

<p><br />
<span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Segoe UI,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Kind Regards,<br />
&nbsp;<br />
{{{Sender.FirstName}}}<br />
Qantas VIP Service Team&nbsp;<br />
Within&nbsp;Australia 1300 752 801<br />
World Wide &nbsp;+61 2 6122 1111</span></span></p>
